**Root cause confirmed:** srv1 runs BIND (`named`) as its DNS authority for `jeremysitlab.com`, but no HTTP server daemon (nginx, Apache, lighttpd, etc.) has been started. Every campus hostname resolves correctly to 10.5.0.4 via the DNS wildcard, but all TCP connections to port 80 are immediately refused because nothing is listening there.

